id: ki-deception
name: Ki Deception
advancement: true
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Bluff
tpCost: 10
# The Basic Attack Maneuver offered beside the Soar and the Movement; at one Opponent, a Clash (Bluff vs
# Perception/Intuition), won, an Energy Charge on it (chat.mjs settleKiDeception).
kiDeception: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Down Burst's Basic Attack in place of the Soar or Movement: at one Opponent, win a Bluff Clash and it gains an Energy
  Charge.
text: >
  Ki Deception: Taking advantage of the confusion, you launch a powerful attack!
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in Bluff
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: Instead of the Soar Maneuver or Movement Maneuver, you may use the Basic Attack Maneuver through the effects of
  Down Burst. If you do, and the Attacking Maneuver targets only one Opponent, make a Clash (Bluff vs
  Perception/Intuition) against that Opponent. If you win, apply an Energy Charge to that Attacking Maneuver.
